   "en": "and of the place of setting (of the west)"
  },
  {
   "verse": 177,
   "ar": "وَلَٰكِنَّ",
   "ml": "പക്ഷേ, എങ്കിലും, എന്നാൽ",
   "en": "but, however, yet"
  },
